# reviews-guard.manifest — the Judge.me review-widget CONTRACT.
# deploy.sh enforces this on every run. It changes ONLY when a widget change is intended
# (then re-run deploy.sh with --reviews-changed and commit the updated reviews-guard.lock).
#
# Format (pipe-delimited, spaces around the pipes):
#   REPO | <repo file path>        | <required marker substring proving the embed/accessor is present>
#   LIVE | <rendered url>          | <required marker substring that must appear in the served HTML>
#
# REPO markers prove the embed is wired in the theme SOURCE (so a deploy can't silently drop it).
# LIVE markers prove the widget actually renders after deploy.

# --- REPO: source files carrying a Judge.me embed or the reviews.rating accessor ---
REPO | templates/page.reviews.json | all_reviews_page
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-cream.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-gel.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.clinical-strength-spray.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-cream.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-gel.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.advanced-strength-spray.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-cream.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-gel.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.professional-strength-spray.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.foaming-cleanser.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.vitamin-a-d-ointment.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.senseless-cosmetics-bag.json | review_widget
REPO | templates/product.bundle.json | review_widget
REPO | sections/senseless-reviews.liquid | @app
REPO | sections/senseless-product-hero.liquid | jdgm-preview-badge
REPO | sections/senseless-collection-grid.liquid | judgeme
REPO | sections/senseless-product-highlights.liquid | jdgm-preview-badge
REPO | sections/senseless-cross-sell.liquid | jdgm-preview-badge
REPO | sections/senseless-product-showcase.liquid | jdgm-preview-badge
REPO | sections/senseless-trio-card-row.liquid | jdgm-preview-badge
REPO | snippets/senseless-jdgm-badge.liquid | judgeme.badge
REPO | snippets/senseless-structured-data.liquid | product.metafields.reviews.rating
REPO | blocks/review.liquid | product.metafields.reviews.rating

# --- REPO: app embeds in config/settings_data.json. A settings_data push whose repo copy LACKS
#     these block types STRIPS the live embeds (happened 2026-06-26: og/share_image push removed
#     Judge.me, Klaviyo, Google & YouTube and Dondy). Gate-a now blocks deploying without them. ---
REPO | config/settings_data.json | judge-me-reviews
REPO | config/settings_data.json | klaviyo
REPO | config/settings_data.json | google-youtube
REPO | config/settings_data.json | dondy

# --- LIVE: rendered widgets that must survive every deploy ---
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/pages/reviews | jdgm-widget
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/pages/reviews | jdgm-histogram
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/products/clinical-strength-cream | jdgm-preview-badge
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/products/clinical-strength-cream | jdgm-widget

# --- LIVE: Google tags (GA4 + Google Tag) injected by the Google & YouTube embed — must survive every deploy ---
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/ | G-N6XKMWQ92N
LIVE | https://senseless.uk/ | GT-WF6JZF4Z
